    {
      "fileName": "glean-lore.json",
      "id": "MJW4VP7PjVAX131C",
      "name": "Glean Lore",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "MJW4VP7PjVAX131C",
        "folder": "YX12dq43VWFIeJwH",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Glean Lore",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You tap into the collected lore of the divine, accessing a variety of potentially useful information.</p>\n<p>Attempt a @Check[religion] check to understand the information you gain. The GM sets the DC (similar to the DC to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Recall Knowledge]), potentially adjusting the DC of the check for topics far removed from your mystery.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You comprehend the lore accurately or gain a useful clue from the divine about your situation.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You learn two pieces of information about the topic, one true and one erroneous, but you don't know which is which.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You recall incorrect information or gain an erroneous or misleading clue.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You recall two pieces of incorrect information or gain two erroneous or misleading clues.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "divine",
              "oracle",
              "secret"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "nudge-the-scales.json",
      "id": "acJkVtpX2GUvl90E",
      "name": "Nudge the Scales",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "acJkVtpX2GUvl90E",
        "folder": "YX12dq43VWFIeJwH",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Nudge the Scales",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You lay a finger on the scales of life and death to heal a creature, regardless of whether it's living or undead. You restore @Damage[(2*(1+@actor.level))[healing]] Hit Points to one creature within 30 feet.</p>\n<p>In addition, you can mediate during your daily preparations to place yourself on one side of the scales. Choose life or death. If you align yourself with life, you can be targeted and healed by vitality healing effects, as normal for most living creatures; if you align yourself with death, you gain the void healing ability, and can instead be targeted and healed by void effects and other effects that restore Hit Points to undead creatures..</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "alwaysActive": true,
              "key": "RollOption",
              "option": "nudge-the-scales",
              "suboptions": [
                {
                  "label": "PF2E.SpecificRule.Oracle.NudgeTheScales.Life",
                  "value": "life"
                },
                {
                  "label": "PF2E.SpecificRule.Oracle.NudgeTheScales.Death",
                  "value": "death"
                }
              ],
              "toggleable": true
            },
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "override",
              "path": "system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing",
              "predicate": [
                "nudge-the-scales:death"
              ],
              "priority": 51,
              "value": true
            }
          ],
